# Central pinned refs for in-lab Paintbot player builds.
#
# One source of truth so builds are reproducible. Sourced by tools/build_player.sh.

# The coworld-ctf game commit stencil's sim-rule constants were derived from
# and whose pinned Nim dependency graph builds the native player. This must be a
# full immutable SHA: Docker fetches that revision's nimby.lock directly. Canonical
# Paintbot 0.7.181 resolved to this source on 2026-08-03. The only game-source
# delta from the parity corpus revision (0.7.180 / 052b058) widens a replay
# viewer hash mask; it does not change simulation or player-wire behavior.
PAINTBOT_GAME_REF=347deefb34f9f6c0001979309f97ec4d89d1a048
